      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > Liquidity",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Liquidity",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "S&P and Moody's long-term debt ratings and short-term debt ratings at April 24, 2026 were unchanged as compared to the ratings at April 25, 2025.",
