      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > Liquidity",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Liquidity",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We do not expect the S&P and Moody's ratings to have a significant impact on our liquidity or future flexibility to access additional liquidity given our balance sheet, Credit Facility, and related commercial paper programs.",
