      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Contractual Obligations and Cash Requirements",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Information regarding our obligations under contingent consideration, debt, lease arrangements, and legal matters are provided in Notes 3, 6, 16, and 18, respectively, to the consolidated financial statements in “Item 8. Financial Statements and Supplementary Data” in this Annual Report on Form 10-K.",
