      "section_type": "mda",
      "section_path": "Part II Item 7 > Liquidity",
      "section_label": "Part II Item 7",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Liquidity",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We also have a $3.5 billion five-year syndicated credit facility (Credit Facility), which expires in December 2030.",
      "char_start": 51623,
      "char_end": 51738,
      "raw_spans": [
        [
          51972,
